<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Your Password Reset Token</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .container { background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #eee; }
        .header { background-color: #0066cc; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; text-align: center; }
        .content { background-color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; text-align: center; }
        .token-box { 
            display: inline-block; 
            background-color: #f0f8ff; 
            border: 2px dashed #0066cc; 
            color: #0066cc; 
            font-size: 32px; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            letter-spacing: 5px; 
            padding: 15px 30px; 
            margin: 20px 0; 
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Password Reset</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>You requested to reset your password for **{{oceaned}}**. Please use the verification token below to proceed:</p>
            
            <div class="token-box">
                {{resetToken}}
            </div>
            
            <p>This token is valid for **{{expiryTime}}**. If you did not request this, please secure your account.</p>
            
            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; 2024 {{oceaned}}. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>